-------------------------------------------------------

  File:      src/backend/AgentSmith.Infrastructure.Core/Resources/asvs-requirements.flat.json
  Work:      OWASP Application Security Verification Standard, version 5.0.0
             (the exact upstream release tag is pinned in one place in the code:
